msgid "Save output {#save-output}"
msgstr "Simpan output {#save-output}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Drawing a large-scale circuit inline in a Jupyter notebook can be slow or unreadable.\n"
"You can save the diagram directly to a file, then open it in an image viewer and zoom in as needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menggambar circuit berskala besar secara langsung di notebook Jupyter bisa lambat atau tidak terbaca.\n"
"Kamu bisa menyimpan diagram langsung ke file, lalu membukanya di penampil gambar dan memperbesar sesuai kebutuhan.\n"

